@iSazonov I haven't reviewed the code very closely, it's been a very long time since I wrote the code I think you're asking about and I think it's a pretty obscure feature.

That said, I think you'll need multiple viable overloads, e.g.:
```powershell
class Foo {
    static [void] func([int]$i) { }
    static [void] func([object]$i) { }
}
[Foo]::func("1")
```

This should trigger the algorithm that decides which overload is best, and I think the code you're modifying is called from `Adapter.GetArgumentConversionRank`.
